<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.48 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.48 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on a repo auction held between Cyprus's central bank and commercial banks was 4.48 percent on Monday after 4.33 percent at the previous auction on April 7, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Bids for bills worth 82.8 million Cyprus pounds ($162 million) were made for the 63 million pounds worth of bills on offer.</p>
<p>Yields ranged from 4.32 percent to 4.61 percent, a statement from the central bank said.</p>
<p>($=0.51 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
